OL,6, FATAL CINEMA FIRE PROBED       R (/q
OL,7,                                R ,'!$#!
OL,8, A major investigation is underway into
OL,9, a blaze which swept through a private
OL,10, cinema killing eight people.
OL,12,FInvestigators are sifting through the
OL,13,Fwreckage caused by the fire which
OL,14,Fpolice are treating as suspicious.
OL,15,F
OL,16,FSix survivors are in a critical
OL,17,Fcondition following the inferno in the
OL,18,Ffour-storey building near London's
OL,19,FSmithfield meat market.
OL,20,A---------------------------------------
OL,21,   FNext story follows in a momentH>>
