OL,6, "THREE SHOT DEAD" IN UNREST  V"/=&
OL,7,F                           V
OL,8, Israeli troops have shot dead three
OL,9, Palestinians and wounded 18 in renewed
OL,10, clashes with protesters enraged by the
OL,11, Hebron mosque massacre, reports said.
OL,12,F
OL,13,FThe army said it was checking the
OL,14,Freports.
OL,15,F
OL,16,CFIsrael has said it is sealing off the
OL,17,Foccupied territories indefinitely in
OL,18,Fthe wake of Arab violence following the
OL,19,Fdeath of 43 Palestinians in Hebron.
OL,20,A---------------------------------------
OL,21,   FNext story follows in a momentH>>
